  i Without an initial value, the store holds undefined until it is set for the first time, which code that reads the store may not expect.
  
  i Pass the initial value as the first argument.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

